Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit clone of `t`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/unmarked_take_keeps_mark_for_cleanup_generic_and_capture_3.jet:6:28
    |
  6 |     f: () -> print(consume(t))
    |                            ^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^t`) if this is the last use, or copy first with `t.copy()`
